flowchart LR
  Local[Local first factor<br/>password / OPAQUE / WebAuthn / email]
  MFA[MFA session<br/>remaining local methods]
  OAuth2[OAuth2 provider]
  Tokens[Access / refresh tokens<br/>with auth context]
  API[HTTP / gRPC business APIs]
  Management[Management gRPC<br/>separate ops token]

  Local -->|2FA enabled| MFA
  MFA -->|second factor verified| Tokens
  Local -->|2FA disabled| Tokens
  OAuth2 -->|independent login trust| Tokens
  Tokens --> API

  CLI[CLI / operators] --> Management

  Note[OAuth2 does not count as a local 2FA factor.<br/>2FA-enabled users may still log in through OAuth2.]
  OAuth2 -.-> Note
